+/*
+ * HFS_META_DELAY is a duration (in usecs) used for triggering the 
+ * hfs_syncer() routine. We will back off if writes are in 
+ * progress, but...
+ * HFS_MAX_META_DELAY is the maximum time we will allow the
+ * syncer to be delayed.
